That is fewer than the 20 a title study wants: say plainly, in the first section, that the patterns rest on few titles.
Number them 1 to 9 in that order. Titles 1 to 3 are the HIGH group and titles 7 to 9 are the LOW group; any between them are the MIDDLE.
</task>

<owner>
The reader is the owner of another channel who wants to compete with this one: “the owner”, “us” and “you” mean that reader.
The owner is one creator with no technical background who makes faceless YouTube videos alone: narration over pictures, nobody on camera. They act on your answer as it stands: they title, design, write, record and publish from it, and nobody rewrites it for them first.
