5. get_script lists under frameStudies the videos of the voice channel whose frames a channel breakdown has studied. When it lists any, call get_frame_study for up to 2 of them.
</gather>

<craft>
THE LENGTH
- Write each section under shortSections to its budget, within a tenth of it. Only spoken words count: headings, cue lines and markers in square brackets do not.
